        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Dead Space is a 2008 science fiction survival horror video game developed by EA Redwood Shores (now Visceral Games) for Microsoft Windows, PlayStation 3 and Xbox 360. The game was released on all platforms through October 2008. The game puts the player in control of an engineer named Isaac Clarke, who battles the Necromorphs, reanimated human corpses, aboard an interstellar mining ship, the USG Ishimura.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Dead Space es un videojuego de supervivencia y terror de ciencia ficción lanzado en 2008, desarrollado por EA Redwood Shores (hoy Visceral Games) para Microsoft Windows, PlayStation 3 y Xbox 360. El juego se lanzó en todas las plataformas hasta octubre de 2008. El jugador controla a un ingeniero llamado Isaac Clarke, que lucha contra los Necromorfos, cadáveres humanos reanimados, a bordo de una nave minera interestelar, la USG Ishimura.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2008",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
